    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but i don't want someone to sit with me in the stillness. i don't want more voices, more presence... i just want the effort to end. it feels like the only way to truly find that peace is to become part of the silence itself. wouldn't it be more beautiful that way? to just... fade away and be at one with the quiet?",
